Research Cycle Flow

Daily cron: POST /api/cron/rank-strategies
  ↓
Load all closed mock trades from MongoDB (paper_trades collection)
  ↓
Group by strategy ID
  ↓
Compute per-strategy metrics:
  ├─ trade count
  ├─ win rate
  ├─ expectancy per trade (winRate × avgWin - (1-winRate) × avgLoss)
  ├─ profit factor (sumWins / sumLosses)
  └─ fee_pct_of_gross (totalFees / abs(grossPnL))
  ↓
Apply verdict logic (client/src/lib/researchEdgeScore.ts — computeVerdict()):
  ├─ PROMOTE: ≥12 trades, positive expectancy, fee/gross < 50%, PF ≥ 1.1
  ├─ KEEP:    ≥12 trades, positive expectancy but fee/gross ≥ 50% or PF < 1.1
  ├─ WATCH:   5–11 trades, positive expectancy (gathering data)
  ├─ DISABLE: ≥5 trades, negative expectancy AND fee/gross > 100%
  └─ INSUFFICIENT: < 5 trades (no verdict)
  ↓
Update strategy rankings (MongoDB or fixture files)
  ↓
Approved strategy list updated → used by mock engine NO_APPROVED_STRATEGY gate
  ↓
Redis cache: live:strategy_rankings:{account} updated (TTL 60s)

Signal Scoring

From scoreMockTraceRow():
  finalScore = signal_score
             + min(50, (signal_score / threshold) * 10)   ← threshold bonus
             + quality_score * 0.15                        ← quality weight
             + mtf_score * 0.10                            ← multi-timeframe weight

From scoreMockResearchSignal():
  finalScore = clamp(confidenceScore, 0, 100)              ← pure confidence

Confidence Scoring (Research Edge)
Trade Count   Confidence Score
< 5           0%
5–11          20%
12–19         40%
20–29         60%
30–49         75%
≥ 50          90%
Max possible: 90% (statistical humility — never 100% confident)

Strategy Ranking Criteria (computeVerdict — researchEdgeScore.ts)
1. Trade count gate (minimum 5 for any verdict, 12 for promotion)
2. Expectancy per trade (must be positive to promote)
3. Fee/gross ratio (must be < 50% to promote)
4. Profit factor (must be ≥ 1.1 to promote)
5. Win rate (Python service: min 35%, min PF 0.95)

Strategy Health — Python StrategyScoringEngine (management.py)
Minimum 8 trades for any health score
Minimum win rate: 35%
Minimum profit factor: 0.95
Auto-disable if health score falls below threshold

Probe Trade Exclusion
Trades tagged BOOTSTRAP, PROBE, DEV_FORCE, CANARY, SMOKE_TEST are excluded from all
scoring metrics. This prevents synthetic/test trades from polluting strategy verdicts.

IMPORTANT GAP — No Out-of-Sample Split
Currently strategies can be promoted entirely on in-sample (paper trading period) data.
Elite V2 + V3 together contribute ~200 near-identical parameter variations. Any promoted
variant is statistically likely to be an overfit parameter selection from 200 random draws.
Mitigation: add holdout gate (last 30% of trade history excluded from promotion scoring).

